li.p:
► A default collection name may be defined at Configuration level;
                  this is then resolved in the same way as any other collection URI. In the absence of such
               a definition, the default collection is empty.

► On the command line, use the -ea option to enable assertion checking.
                  In s9api, assertions must be enabled at compile time using XsltCompiler.setAssertionsEnabled(true);
                  if required they can then be disabled at evaluation time using Xslt30Transformer.setAssertionsEnabled(false).

► Saxon recognizes the namespace http://saxon.sf.net/ for its own extensions;
                  it also recognizes extensions in various namespaces defined by the EXSLT and EXPath
                  communities.

Use of a path expression that can never select anything (for example
@a/@b
)
